{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"906d9cbbc51e84139ea2876d798ea3405331fb272a6f8d9cfbd1234f5d4c69ef","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"7f60be84831e253588f411aa79f23205b8871a22f7e336288610bf3e2e20512d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7f742d9a6c15761f034d984967dc0f1d55e17d09db4350264c238407fcbf99c5","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7f8b404792ae3d8c261148d7f46d72b329e146dc05d5f67b9445d59231da967d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7fa0ec8106be424fc64618775c86352b407840039a7cf75f9ad9ccc22653992e","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7fb726a73fd9e4923e1c5261452a85d42bd16b3fff2f0f2e5568b658a5db5019","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7fccc502041fb2bebb25acfcd46f1a13bd7d8fe8c82b3aa2020468bb80e828da","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"机制与术语错误：源文 \"Conjures up a bolt of fire\" 被译为「制造一个火球」。补查 engine 组件 game/modules/tome/data/talents/spells/fire.lua（固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，锚点行 82-84 所属 newTalent 的 target 函数，约 34-38 行）：该天赋 target 为 `local tg = {type=\"bolt\", ...}`，并且 `if self:getTalentLevel(t) >= 5 then tg.type = \"beam\" end`，action 中低于 5 级走 `self:projectile(...)`，5 级及以上走 `self:project(...)` 配 flamebeam 粒子。即效果是单体火焰弹（bolt）在 5 级升级为贯穿光束（beam），全程不存在爆炸范围。译为「火球」既与 bolt 的单体弹道机制不符，也与同文件中另有独立的范围性 Fireball 系火焰法术形成术语撞车，会让玩家误判为范围伤害。"},{"revision_key":"7ff9f6d666cbd052239384b55f8f168ddb9db6c25a0d34d813c5d341298d0470","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8003d8554801e3aa5c86e4ad62e7398d1abf85a2cbc1ec13292352460a454838","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8021bb48586dd7e1d26f5dd64ccab2e3e9c765679fe4dba428283ee2b87b5dd0","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8031500f26922fa0644cc33ae1d918f5fd96c00bbcd06116e33d56c72db20799","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"动作语义错误：\"taps %s %s together\" 被译为「将%s %s拼在一起」。补查 engine 组件 game/modules/tome/data/zones/demon-plane/objects.lua（固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，锚点行 50 所在 BOOTS_OF_PHASING / Shifting Boots 条目的 use_power.use，约 48-54 行）：调用为 `game.logSeen(who, \"%s taps %s %s together!\", who:getName():capitalize(), who:his_her(), self:getName{...})`，随后 `who:teleportRandom(...)` 并播放 teleport 粒子。即该日志描述的是使用者把自己的（his/her）靴子互相轻叩/碰击以触发随机闪烁，而非把两件物品拼接组合。「拼在一起」表示拼接成一体，与 tap together 的敲击动作不符，也与后续仅发生传送、物品状态不变的实际机制矛盾。"},{"revision_key":"8048d1275e86af8265cdb92607af6a05ce88b7d0678001ecb22007f2a9f9df53","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8054bf090a27215decf490769faf66c309786a5dbfa4ac4759ee57024ab71b87","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"807494f684b1afb1c569c5b7d869b81024098d4a9cf75d0a55d54371a91a4980","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"机制陈述错误：\"has greatly expanded your capacity for improving your mind and body\" 被译为「大大提升了你的智力和体能」。补查 engine 组件 game/modules/tome/data/general/objects/brotherhood-artifacts.lua（固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，锚点行 144 所在 ELIXIR_MASTERY / Elixir of Mastery 条目，约 133-148 行）：use_power 名称为 \"grant you four additional stat points\"，use 体内唯一的数值变更是 `who.unused_stats = who.unused_stats + 4`，紧接着提示 \"You have %d stat point(s) to spend. Press G to use them.\"。即药剂只给 4 点待分配属性点（提升的是「可提升的余地/上限」），并不直接改变任何属性值。译文断言「提升了你的智力和体能」会让玩家以为属性已自动增加而不去分配点数；且 mind/body 是泛指身心，译为具体属性名「智力」也与实际可分配到任意属性不符。"}]}